Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说服你们做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to talk all of you into doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I know we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.77,0:00:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该如何开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know how to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你们活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里撑不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna last here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸会成群结队地来袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The biters, there'll be a herd of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会填满坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll fill the pits,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个叠一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll crawl over one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前赴后继  最后入侵我们的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be enough to tear right through our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不来活人也会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it'll be people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们和外面的世界之间没有阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing between us and the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们和他们之间毫无阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing between us and them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们留在这里  就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stay here, we'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摧毁了我和马丁内斯所在的营地的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people who destroyed the camp I was in with Martinez...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们住在一座监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they live in a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在34号高速公路以北\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's north off Highway 34.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有围墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got walls...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}fences,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可供耕种的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}plots of land for farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以住在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们愿意从他们手上抢过来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're willing to take it from 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.33,0:01:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个计划  可以避免任何人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a plan to do it without anyone getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓获了他们的两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I captured two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:44.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在侦查监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scouting the prison
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碰上了他们  所以我把他们带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our paths crossed, so I took 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你带回了他们  -他们是进监狱的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You took them? - They're the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会帮我们不费一枪一弹夺取那座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna help us take that prison without firing a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能得到监狱  而且不必杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have it and we don't need to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.69,0:02:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.91,0:02:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得做好杀人的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to be prepared to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱里的那些人并非都是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people in this prison, not all of them are bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:53.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但大部分都是小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most of them are thieves,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谋杀犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么那种人能逍遥自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why should people like that have peace of mind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们却每天都在掩埋同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we're burying our own just about every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人致我残疾\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people, they mutilated me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.23,0:03:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧了我的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}burned my camp...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见了  我尝试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you saw me-- I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尝试过去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不想接受  在这世界存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I didn't want to accept that you couldn't live in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就必须杀人这一事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}without getting blood on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我找到了你们  我不想死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found you people and I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:29.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想让你们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we need to move-- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会发觉他们的人失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna realize their people are gone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会为接下来的事做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're gonna start getting ready for whatever's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得攻其不备  吓到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to surprise them. Scare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我加入  -我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in. - Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收拾东西  做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack up and get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半小时后我们定计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go over the plan in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走吧  -就这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:15.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅根在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Megan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在拖车里看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's reading in the trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过我们不必抢另一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said we didn't have to fight for another place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要杀人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  杀谋杀犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Killing killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过他们不全是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said they weren't all bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们和坏人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're with bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你活下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让梅根活下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep Megan alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一在乎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only judgment on me I care about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你俩是不是活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}is whether you two are still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good that you heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道了很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉  我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily... I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.40,0:05:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我说过一定还有更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you told me there has to be someplace better
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还叫我帮你找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that I was gonna help you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我  莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew me, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always gonna be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也得收拾收拾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to pack up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别碰我  -别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't touch me. - Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该吃点东西  今天将会是漫长的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should eat. It's gonna be a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人会伤害你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就告诉我们这是怎么回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell us what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩  我想让你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, I want you to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佩妮  我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penny, my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了  我如今意识到了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was dead. I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.51,0:06:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要监狱  就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the prison, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一伙人的性命我得保住\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people I need to keep alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩要帮我夺得监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are gonna help me take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one needs to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我会用我的...  -别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna take my-- - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(度假好去处)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  而且我会尽可能和平地接管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And I'll take it as peacefully as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-总督  -别那样叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Governor-- - Don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人  还有我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people, our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能找到一个和平共处的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can find a way to live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些你要护着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people you need to keep alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爱他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you love them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好人  赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man, Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:16.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比瑞克要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}A better man than Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的每一句话  你说话的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've said, the way you've said it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明你变了  而瑞克也变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've changed. So has Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩永远也不可能生活在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of us will never be able to live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩和我  我们也不可能生活在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne and I, we'll never be able to live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们会找到办法的  -我已经找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll find a way. - I found a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有各种各样的办法能达到目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's all kinds of ways I could do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这个办法  你们能活下去  而我能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, you get to live and I get to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:08:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你想尽可能和平地接管这个监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you want to take this prison as peacefully as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那意味着为了夺得它你也不惜伤害一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you'd be willing to hurt people to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的女儿们在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughters would be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有可能伤害到她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who you'd be hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你真理解有个女儿的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you understand what it's like to have a daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么能威胁别人女儿的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}then how can you threaten to kill someone else's?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为她们不是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they aren't mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回来前他们会安全地待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be safe here until we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸没办法过河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biters can't make it across the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如在水边很安全的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's safe by the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就直接找个靠水的地方啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}then let's just go someplace by the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-莉莉  -你没必要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lily. - You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何安全的地方  真正安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyplace that's safe, really safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.26,0:09:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经被人占了\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone's already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为梅根想想  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about Megan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:17.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在这样的一个世界上会变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she gonna be in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会成为幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在做泥巴馅饼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making mud pies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花生酱三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peanut butter sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我走之前抱抱我怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a hug before I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我手上都是泥巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands are muddy. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我可不想把我的外套弄脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wouldn't want to get my coat dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把你弄得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I messed it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  你让我更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you made it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真想度个假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去散散心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个周末就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for a weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:10:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的周年纪念日快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, our anniversary is coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:10.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去过阿米科罗拉瀑布吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever been to Amicalola Falls?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔治亚最高的瀑布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tallest waterfall in Georgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小时候我爸爸带我去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad took me there when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:16.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们站在顶端的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从上往下看\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way at the top looking down,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉像是在飞一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt like I was flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就去给旅行车装行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go load up the station wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去给你拿点水喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我能去拿  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can get it. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能等我们回来再处理这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you couldn't have waited till we got back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等泰尔西回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Tyreese got back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能应付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've handled that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了两个自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed two of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不能待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有一辆车  供给品还有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a car, supplies, weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她...她能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话连你自己都不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop saying that like you don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了人  她说是为了我们大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it. She said it was for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是那么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it was in her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不觉得愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是这样  但这不是她的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that's her, but that ain't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两个小女孩怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do about those two girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉她我们会照顾她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her we'd look after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有告诉泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told Tyreese yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他会有什么反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how he's gonna take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看看就得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,折腾了一晚上  你也应该休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the night you had, so should you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.38,0:13:46.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正要去C区找一个空狱房\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way to find an open cell in C block
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.19,0:13:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到D区被收拾干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until D gets cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to say
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是赫谢尔跟你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here if it wasn't for Hershel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了赫谢尔  不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你也帮忙了  -别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You helped save my life. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:11.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-鲍勃  -别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bob. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把那些药放到了我的输液里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put those meds in my IV bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  还有几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, in a couple minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就能看到明天的太阳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna feel the sun on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你得让我谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are gonna let me thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有完全恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not strong enough yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西  你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese. You down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys got to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能一会儿再去吗  我们得先谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we take a beat? There's something we need to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个不着急  先过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can wait. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.82,0:15:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}answers...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.65,0:15:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀掉凯伦和大卫的人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same person that killed Karen and David did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得栅栏那里的老鼠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the rats at the fence?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是在她被杀当天出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They showed up the same day she was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们队伍里有个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a psychopath living with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-泰尔西  -我们得找到他  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tyreese. - We got to find him, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不找到他我决不罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna sleep until we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干这事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever did this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕不是杀死凯伦的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's who killed Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:50.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不了主\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有委员会  由他们管理这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a council now. They run this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,委员会里有赫谢尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Hershel on the council?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:16:57.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有米琼恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Michonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,委员会也有她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She on the council, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不再由我做决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't make decisions anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天你得做  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making the decisions today, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  我们谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come down here. Let's have that talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能行  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对付不了这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take 'em all on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们按照之前计划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go through the admin building,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿过管理楼进入林子  \N{\fnArial\fs30}through the woods like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在没有人数优势了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't got the numbers no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次查大巴上的补给是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time someone checked the stash on the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去基地的前一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day before we hit the Big Spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时我们的口粮不多  现在更少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were running low on rations then. We're lower now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会想到办法的  如果情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll manage. Things go south,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通知大家  都上大巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone heads for that bus. Let everybody know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.51,0:19:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果情况不妙却没人知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if everybody doesn't know when things go bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要等多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽可能多等一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就放他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想谈多久就谈多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk as long as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得放他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you let 'em go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有坦克  完全不需要人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a tank. You don't need hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了告诉你我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just to show you I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会给新家轰个大洞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to blast a hole in our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和你的人  日落之前离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your people, you have till sundown to get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则他们就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't have to go down this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人马和武器都比你多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got more people, more firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要这座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟以前无关  一切只关乎现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about the past. It's about right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are children here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的病了  在外面他们活不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them are sick. They won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有辆坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却让你们安全地离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm letting you walk away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么好废话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else is there to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.35,0:20:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:22:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.10,0:22:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能帮我挖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you please help me dig?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.65,0:22:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  能帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, can you please help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上过去  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  太沉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, it's too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there in a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  亲爱的  你刚说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, honey. What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.17,0:22:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我自己能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(警告  山洪多发地段)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy! Mommy! 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.11,0:23:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.90,0:23:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.44,0:23:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以向你们开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could shoot you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.87,0:24:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会反击  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd all shoot back. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.53,0:24:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但最终我们会赢  你们会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll win and you'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.68,0:24:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.46,0:24:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't have to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.59,0:24:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我先前说的  由你选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, it's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.09,0:24:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动静太大只会吸引更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noise will only draw more of them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.91,0:24:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你等得越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer you wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.08,0:24:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就越难以离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the harder it will be for you to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:51.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.78,0:24:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸能处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.54,0:24:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只顾着说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.89,0:24:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就可以杀了总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could kill the Governor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:25:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-隔着45米远吗  -我枪法很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From 50 yards? - I'm a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.61,0:25:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就可以结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could end this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.42,0:25:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  或者失手了挑起战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or you could start something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.16,0:25:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you guys going?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.76,0:25:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去大巴上  走吧  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To the bus. Come on. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.44,0:25:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是计划  我们应该去大巴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the plan. That's where we're supposed to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.93,0:25:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔告诉我们要坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol told us to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.01,0:25:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护自己  他们有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect ourselves. They have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.16,0:25:30.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也应该有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have guns, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.95,0:25:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.35,0:25:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳下山前  你们大概还有一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got maybe about an hour of sunlight left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.83,0:25:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你们开始打包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you start packing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.62,0:25:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拖得时间越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer you wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.28,0:26:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越难从这里安全离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}the harder it's gonna be for you to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.45,0:26:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can all--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.27,0:26:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一块住\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can all live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.73,0:26:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房间足够全部人住进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's enough room for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.55,0:26:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地方是很充裕\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.29,0:26:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我的家人跟你们住在同一屋檐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think my family would sleep well knowing 
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.36,0:26:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是睡不了安稳觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you were under the same roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.54,0:26:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以住在不同的牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd live in different cell blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.07,0:26:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们能接受对方之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd never have to see each other
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.95,0:26:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不用见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}till we're all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.27,0:26:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这方法可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.37,0:26:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.38,0:26:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.89,0:26:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.95,0:26:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.61,0:26:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和安德莉亚的事情之后  不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.27,0:26:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有说  这可以轻松实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying it's gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.47,0:26:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  这比我们站在这里互相开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, it's gonna be a hell of a lot harder
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.32,0:27:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要难上一万倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}than standing here shooting at each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.93,0:27:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们没有其它选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有  你们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't. You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.20,0:27:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想逼我们离开  我们会拼死抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try and force us, we'll fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.62,0:27:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你刚才说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.22,0:27:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪声会引来更多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gunshots will just bring more of them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:26.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们会挤倒围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll take down the fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.53,0:27:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了围栏  这个地方就毫无价值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the fences, this place is worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.12,0:27:35.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要不然就一起住在监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we can all live in the prison
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.32,0:27:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然就谁都住不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or none of us can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会修好那个该死的围栏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll fix the damn fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.67,0:27:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No--!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.51,0:28:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  梳马尾辫的那个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. You in the ponytails.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.72,0:28:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你想要的吗  这是你们想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you want? Is this what any of you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.13,0:28:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要的就是你们的监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we want is what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.07,0:28:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.95,0:28:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们该滚蛋了  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for you to leave, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.26,0:28:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我以前和他打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I fought him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.95,0:28:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后  我们收留了他以前的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after, we took in his old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.92,0:28:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们成了我们这里的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've become leaders in what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.98,0:28:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们现在放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you put down your weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.44,0:28:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那些门进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}walk through those gates...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们既往不咎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let go of all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人会伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nobody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:55.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有现在活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who's alive right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.96,0:29:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有坚持到现在的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who's made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.20,0:29:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了活下去  我们都不择手段过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all done the worst kinds of things just to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们依旧可以回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can still come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.40,0:29:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没有走得太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.75,0:29:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还可以回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.73,0:29:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.49,0:29:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是可以改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.12,0:29:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.83,0:30:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.15,0:30:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.76,0:30:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.79,0:31:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.55,0:31:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起枪  快战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up your weapon! Fight, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.71,0:31:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.77,0:31:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不该这样做  -必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not supposed to be doing this. - We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.54,0:31:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他竟然用刀砍下了那人的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chopped a guy's head off with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.59,0:31:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须留下  已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stay here. It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.07,0:31:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.60,0:31:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟在我后面  如果我们走散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay behind me and if we get separated,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.06,0:31:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就找一个安全的地方躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just go run somewhere safe and hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.12,0:31:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吗  找个安全的地方躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? You go someplace safe and hide
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.26,0:32:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等这一切结束后  我会去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will find you when this is all over. I will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.91,0:32:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开车进围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go through the fence in your cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.40,0:32:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿上枪  我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your guns, we go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.64,0:32:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀光他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.97,0:32:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵命  前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.61,0:32:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.98,0:33:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没弹药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.10,0:33:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑去大巴那边  我掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for the bus. I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.71,0:33:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.37,0:33:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑  离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.09,0:33:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑  格伦还在里面  我得去接他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Come on! Glenn's in there. I have to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.34,0:33:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我跟你一起  -不  你去让人们上大巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going with you. - No, get these people on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-随时准备出发  我马上回来  -如果你回不来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be ready to drive. I'll be right back. - What if you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.08,0:33:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那就丢下我先走  -我不能丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have to go without us. - I won't go without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.98,0:33:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝  让大家上大巴  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, get these people on the bus, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.19,0:33:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的职责  我们要各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your job. We've all got jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.91,0:34:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-格伦  -发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn! - What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.89,0:34:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得带大家离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get everybody out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.37,0:35:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝  贝丝在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth! Where's Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.08,0:35:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她去找你了  -她去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She went to find you. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.39,0:35:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到她的  她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find her. She'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.40,0:35:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别来  -什么  不行  你不能自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - What? No, you're not going by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.92,0:35:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.83,0:35:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.97,0:35:54.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.51,0:36:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手榴弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.79,0:36:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙  萨沙  你看见贝丝了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha! Sasha! Have you seen Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.43,0:36:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她在大巴上吗  -没有  她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she on the bus? - No. She's--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.14,0:36:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别起身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.22,0:36:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掀开衣服  看看子弹有没有穿过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look inside my shirt. Check my back for an exit wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.47,0:36:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.25,0:36:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  还能治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. We can treat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.61,0:36:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不能在这里治  -低头  我们找个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not here. - Stay down. We'll find someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.32,0:36:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想别的办法  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.03,0:37:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.64,0:37:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! We go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.20,0:38:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl...?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.05,0:38:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.45,0:38:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.92,0:38:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手榴弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.27,0:39:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在找孩子们  让他们上大巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to find the kids to get them on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.19,0:39:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须走了  贝丝  必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go, Beth. We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.51,0:39:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.09,0:39:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.51,0:39:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.41,0:39:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.34,0:40:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.05,0:40:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.40,0:40:06.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.05,0:40:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.81,0:40:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl. Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.42,0:40:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:40:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.52,0:41:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.91,0:42:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别回头  卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look back, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.10,0:42:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep walking.
